    "_emoji_help": [
        "Unicode emoji work in every slot below.",
        "Custom and ANIMATED emoji (<a:name:id>) are only safe in 'online' and",
        "'offline', which the bot renders in the embed description -- Discord",
        "guarantees custom emoji there. Field names may render them as raw text",
        "depending on client, so keep unicode in the rest unless you test first.",
        "Get an id by typing \\:emojiname: in Discord and sending it.",
        "Set any value to \"\" to hide that emoji."
